cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "TeamStarWolf: An Open Cybersecurity Reference Library for the Community"
message: "If you use this library in your work, teaching, or research, please cite it."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "TeamStarWolf"
    website: "https://github.com/TeamStarWolf"
repository-code: "https://github.com/TeamStarWolf/TeamStarWolf"
url: "https://teamstarwolf.github.io/TeamStarWolf/"
abstract: >-
  An open cybersecurity reference library for defenders, learners, and anyone
  with a security job to do: in-depth practitioner references, step-by-step
  how-to guides, and discipline learning paths. Original content is MIT-licensed.
  The library also publishes generated framework pages, machine-readable mapping
  data, and ATT&CK Navigator layers. The references and data are cross-referenced
  to MITRE ATT&CK, CAPEC, CWE, D3FEND, ATLAS, Engage, F3, EMB3D, and FiGHT, and to
  NIST SP 800-53 controls.
keywords:
  - cybersecurity
  - threat-informed-defense
  - mitre-attack
  - detection-engineering
  - threat-intelligence
  - nist-800-53
  - blue-team
  - incident-response
  - vulnerability-management
license: MIT
